  m_text: '<b>WASD</b> move    <b>Shift</b> sprint    <b>Mouse</b> look    <b>Q /
    E</b> lean

    <b>Space</b> jump, hold to keep hopping    <b>Space at a ledge</b>
    climb

    <b>Ctrl or C</b> crouch; at a run, slide    <b>Left click</b> blast   
    <b>Esc</b> menu

    <b>Pad</b>  sticks move and look    <b>A</b> jump    <b>B</b>
    crouch    <b>L3</b> sprint

    <b>LB / RB</b> lean    <b>RT</b> blast    <b>Start</b>
    menu'
